  Shake preview (elide)
  Estimated conversation: 280,000 → 180,000
  tokens. Frees ~100,000 (36%).
  24 tool outputs and 8 text blocks. Recent
  ~4k tokens stay protected; removed text
  is recoverable.

  Idle: 45m since last response. Cache
  expiry is not observed.
  Request estimate: 300,000 → 200,000
  (latest context minus reduction; overhead
  may differ).
  Codex: May leave >272k tier (2x input,
  1.5x output); ~72,000 tokens margin.
  Cold cache: next input ~67% cheaper.
  Warm cache, full invalidation: next input
  ~233% more; break-even by request ~5.
  Assumes standard rates, fixed sizes and
  subsequent cache hits.
  Configured compact budget: 290,000.
  Estimated headroom 0 → 90,000 tokens
  (model may compact earlier).
  Favor shake when it delays compaction,
  not simply before /compact.

  Conversation excludes instructions/tools.
  Costs exclude recovery and output; not
  plan-allowance predictions.

› 1. Shake
  2. Cancel

  Press enter to confirm or esc to go back
